e reconnection to long-running jobs. The Language Task SDK (experimental) lets teams write task logic in Java or Go while keeping orchestration in Python. Additional improvements include expanded asset partitioning, pluggable retry policies, and bulk actions for","route":"pulse","routeCandidates":["pulse","research-queue"],"priorityScore":73.7,"band":"selected","publicationReadiness":"eligible-by-rules","evidenceStatus":"officially_confirmed","sourceTiers":["T1"],"independentSourceCount":1,"coreCompanies":["Amazon"],"entities":["Amazon"],"region":"全球","facts":[{"factType":"date","valueText":"2026-09-01T15:00:00.000Z","qualifier":"published_at","confidenceState":"source-stated","sourceObservationId":"obs-275dcf84b575d00231f3"}],"sourceChain":[{"observationId":"obs-275dcf84b575d00231f3","sourceId":"aws-news","tier":"T1","independenceGroup":"amazon","relationship":"origin","noveltyClass":"new-event","newFactCount":0,"title":"Amazon MWAA supports Apache Airflow version 3.3.1","url":"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2026/09/amazon-mwaa-apache-airflow-3-3-1/","publishedAt":"2026-09-01T15:00:00.000Z","accessStatus":"public"}],"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-01T15:00:00.000Z","lastUpdatedAt":"2026-09-01T15:00:00.000Z","sourceLastUpdatedAt":"2026-09-01T15:00:00.000Z","result":{"schemaVersion":"atlas-model-score.v1","mode":"shadow","routeImpact":false,"provider":"deterministic-fallback","model":"deterministic-atlas-fallback-v1","scoredAt":"2026-09-03T08:50:03.044Z","scores":{"topicRelevanceScore":5,"mechanismDepthScore":2.5,"specificityScore":4.5,"researchValueScore":4.4,"readerValueScore":4},"semanticScore":4.1,"rationale":"确定性回退：沿用来源扫描的五维评分；最高来源层级 T1；首个可访问来源 AWS News。","reasonCodes":["deterministic-editorial-fallback","primary-source-path","copy-not-generated"],"usage":{"promptTokens":0,"completionTokens":0,"totalTokens":0}}},{"eventId":"evt-1765ddcffaf1a90a49a7","titleZh":"Path to Astra: critical capabilities and frontier safeguards","titleEn":"Path to Astra: critical cap